 select suitable people to join the project many boys and girls with great mental ability are gathered in the research city Alpha.\nThe protagonist is one of the best candidates, and while acquiring training they interact with the other candidates.\n\nWhile conversing with the other candidates there aren't just the usual conversation options. It is also possible to choose Happy/Normal/Sad/Mad emotional type responses.", "summary": "\u00c9lan plus is a renewed version of \u00c9lan, a simulation game in which the player 's objective is to be chosen as a crew on a crew exploration vehicle heading to Planet Elan. New features include scenarios and a Gallery Mode which allows you to view event graphics after clearing stages. But it all depends on you whether you can make it to Planet Elan.\n\nIt adds scenario corrections, new graphics, gallery mode, in game load, and reset functions.", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/elan-plus", "videos": [{"id": 54249, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "DabPc3bgp0c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DabPc3bgp0c", "title": "PS\u300eelan plus(\u30a8\u30e9\u30f3\u30fb\u30d7\u30e9\u30b9)\u300f\uff08\u7537\u4e3b\u4eba\u516c\uff09\u3010\u30e8\u30a6\u3011\u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8\uff06\u30a8\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DabPc3bgp0c/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 54250, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "C0xXjFOdiqU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C0xXjFOdiqU", "title": "PlayStation - Elan Plus (2000) - [Intro]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/C0xXjFOdiqU/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}